{"id":"a8c38c1b75c00823","group":"72","path":"72/72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict.md","title":"外延值不能识别所有形式树","display":"ex-tree-value-nonstrict — 外延值不能识别所有形式树","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict","aliases":["72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict"],"display":"ex-tree-value-nonstrict — 外延值不能识别所有形式树","depends_on":["[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]"],"chapter":"III","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.III Definitions2.1,2.7 print153–154/PDF165–166; local degenerate limit example","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-tree-value-nonstrict — 外延值不能识别所有形式树"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"III"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.III Definitions2.1,2.7 print153–154/PDF165–166; local degenerate limit example"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下式的常序列每项均为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_\\Omega,\\prec\">\\(v_\\Omega,\\prec\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" href=\"?note=c9a2f15ef4424ad4\" title=\"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value\">72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_0:=\\mathsf L((\\mathbf0)_{i\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\lambda_0\\ne\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\mathbf0\\prec\\lambda_0,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda_0)=v_\\Omega(\\mathbf0)=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda_0:=\\mathsf L((\\mathbf0)_{i\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\lambda_0\\ne\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\mathbf0\\prec\\lambda_0,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda_0)=v_\\Omega(\\mathbf0)=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>两个根标签分别是形式极限和零，故树编码不同；零树是极限树的直接子树。外延值的极限子句却给 sup{0}=0。该例不满足结构化树的相邻分支相容条件，不反驳结构化子树的良序结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value","status":"resolved","id":"c9a2f15ef4424ad4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"下式的常序列每项均为 $\\mathbf0$；$v_\\Omega,\\prec$ 使用 [[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf0","display":false},{"tex":"v_\\Omega,\\prec","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_0:=\\mathsf L((\\mathbf0)_{i\\in\\omega}),\\qquad\n\\lambda_0\\ne\\mathbf0,\\qquad\\mathbf0\\prec\\lambda_0,\\qquad\nv_\\Omega(\\lambda_0)=v_\\Omega(\\mathbf0)=0.","display":true}],"bytes":1336,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-31","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"5d6d95eb13748e1d","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"III章新增5项：[[72-df-tree-ordinal-extensional-value]] · [[72-ex-equal-ordinals-different-hierarchies]] · [[72-ex-tree-value-nonstrict]] · [[72-lem-tree-value-arithmetic]] · [[72-thm-structured-tree-value-order]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd